<p>We started CANAXESS because we believe there’s a better way to approach web accessibility.</p> 

<p>Rather than focusing solely on compliance, we prioritise helping teams create websites that truly work for disabled people. By putting their needs first, we ensure your website is genuinely accessible.</p> 

<p>With deep technical expertise in web development, we’re uniquely positioned to help you achieve accessibility in a practical and effective way.</p> 

<p>Our approach focuses on accurate, pragmatic guidance, centred on the user. Simplifying the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) to make the guidelines easier for you to understand and implement.</p> 

<p>Partnering with us means less time spent deciphering complex advice and more time creating accessible digital products that make a real impact.</p> 

<p>Accessibility is at the heart of everything we do. We research, write, and present extensively on the topic, and we proudly consider ourselves <strong>The Web Accessibility Experts</strong>.</p> 

